        <mxCell id="dfail" link="cicd-walkthrough.md#d-qualify-the-initial-release" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=16;strokeColor=#334155;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=none;fontSize=14;" value="FAILURE RULE: any unexpected operation failure stops D and retains the attempt for inspection. No automatic reset or user_acceptance_test promotion.&#xa;All archive operations recheck identity/environment and use verified archive SQL. --rehearse substitutes runtime API examples; no browser acceptance claimed.&#xa;Source: cicd-walkthrough-D_integration_test.sh → initial_install() → cicd-release-step.sh / cicd-release-result.sh. Exact actions: main walkthrough D." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="65" width="1550" x="25" y="1190" as="geometry" />
